# Dagric OS Pro — Security Suite
# (Pro-only; removed for free builds. Free keeps the strong baseline:
# AppArmor, hardened kernel, firewalld, Lynis audit.)

# OpenSnitch — interactive per-application outbound firewall (Linux's
# "Little Snitch"). Ships in monitor/permissive mode by default so it never
# breaks connectivity or storms prompts; the user opts into blocking from the
# GUI. eBPF modules must match Debian's kernel — this pulls the matching set.
opensnitch
python3-opensnitch-ui
opensnitch-ebpf-modules

# USBGuard — USB device authorization (blocks BadUSB / USB-drop attacks).
# Installed but the service is NOT enabled by default (enabling it would block
# an unknown USB keyboard). Surfaced as an opt-in "Lock down USB ports" toggle.
usbguard
usbguard-notifier
